Title: Model Based Clustering for Spherical Data Using Elliptically
        Symmetric Distributions
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-05-28
Authors@R: c( person("Michail", "Tsagris", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mtsagris@uoc.gr"), 
